The following 7 patches remove files in preparation for new functionality
for libsemanage. Some of the removals represent renames. They should apply
to the current NSA cvs repository.

These patches (and the patch set after them) represent in process
development and have been lightly tested. There are likely bugs and I expect
further changes, but think that the code is sufficiently complete to merge
for coordination with other ongoing development.

Please apply.

